### IntelliJ HTTP Client 또는 터미널 curl 로 실행하세요.
### 서버 실행 후 샘플 계좌: 110-0001(홍길동), 110-0002(김철수)

### 1. 전체 계좌 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts

### 2. 계좌 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/110-0001

### 3. 계좌 개설
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "owner": "이영희", "initialBalance": 30000 }

### 4. 입금
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts/110-0001/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 50000 }

### 5. 출금
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts/110-0001/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 20000 }

### 6. 이체 (110-0001 → 110-0002)
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "110-0001", "to": "110-0002", "amount": 30000 }

### 7. 예금주 변경
PUT http://localhost:8080/accounts/110-0002
Content-Type: application/json

{ "owner": "김영희" }

### 8. 계좌 해지
DELETE http://localhost:8080/accounts/110-0002

### 9. (에러 테스트) 잔액 부족 출금 → 400 + 메시지
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts/110-0001/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 99999999 }
